iiwa_sim

The meshes under meshes/lbr_iiwa_14_r820 and the kinematic and inertial
parameters in urdf/iiwa.urdf.xacro come from the iiwa_description package of
ICube-Robotics/iiwa_ros2 (maintainer M. Bednarczyk, Université de Strasbourg),
distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, as vendored in v1.0.0 of this
repository. Unused files (MoveIt configuration, SRDF, RViz layouts, the Flex
Fellow cart and duplicate meshes) were removed; the link_7 flange mesh and mass
are the v1.0.0 modifications. The macro was restructured, the link_7 collision
geometry was removed, and the Gazebo and ros2_control blocks were rewritten.

